{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_local_roadmap_temp_project_progress_updates_docs_portal_plan", "label": "/docs developer portal plan (spec-driven, 3-pane, SSG)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/local-roadmap/\ud83d\udea9TEMP-project-progress-updates.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "@scalar/api-reference is a single infinite-scroll page \u2014 it cannot give per-endpoint URLs, interleave MDX guides, or prerender \u2014 so a custom 3-pane SSG shell renders endpoint pages from api-specs.ts and Scalar is used only for try-out."}, {"id": "docs_local_roadmap_temp_project_progress_updates_scalar_tryit", "label": "Try-it via Scalar modal + ClientPlugin.beforeRequest", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/local-roadmap/\ud83d\udea9TEMP-project-progress-updates.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "x-pre-request script signing is dead in this api-client build (no script sandbox in the send path, and useApiClient can't forward plugins); the correct hook is beforeRequest, which runs after auth headers and before send, so signing stays our own code."}, {"id": "docs_local_roadmap_temp_project_progress_updates_eko_signing", "label": "eko-signing.ts in-browser HMAC signing (Web Crypto)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/local-roadmap/\ud83d\udea9TEMP-project-progress-updates.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Signs at the moment of send (a stale timestamp 403s) and deletes access_key so it is never transmitted; user-supplied UAT creds only, no bundled secrets, DEV-gated prefill so production builds never reference it."}, {"id": "docs_local_roadmap_temp_project_progress_updates_repo_rename", "label": "Repo rename eko-eps-website \u2192 eko-eps-platform", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/local-roadmap/\ud83d\udea9TEMP-project-progress-updates.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three axes get conflated \u2014 repo name, npm org scope, package names \u2014 and only the first changes. GitHub redirects old URLs indefinitely, so most updates are cosmetic; the one functional edit is the marketplace path in /plugin marketplace add."}, {"id": "docs_local_roadmap_temp_project_progress_updates_ai_native_plan", "label": "AI-Native EPS Platform high-level plan (spine + 5 phases)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/local-roadmap/\ud83d\udea9TEMP-project-progress-updates.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Static-first, Node backend only when truly required; per-request HMAC signing is the differentiation lever because OpenAPI can't express it and generic codegen produces broken auth."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_local_roadmap_temp_project_progress_updates_docs_portal_plan", "target": "docs_local_roadmap_temp_project_progress_updates_scalar_tryit", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/local-roadmap/\ud83d\udea9TEMP-project-progress-updates.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_local_roadmap_temp_project_progress_updates_scalar_tryit", "target": "docs_local_roadmap_temp_project_progress_updates_eko_signing", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/local-roadmap/\ud83d\udea9TEMP-project-progress-updates.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_local_roadmap_temp_project_progress_updates_docs_portal_plan", "target": "docs_static_page_generation_app_server_split", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/local-roadmap/\ud83d\udea9TEMP-project-progress-updates.md